  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CTP&apos;s contribution towards the Ecumenical pilgrimage in South Sudan.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pope, the Archbishop of Canterbury and the Moderator of the Church of Scotland are visiting Juba for an ecumenical pilgrimage to pray for peace in South Sudan. CTP are supporting South Sudan Council of Churches with various advocacy and logistics support in preparation for this visit. This includes provision of resources (lanyards) and giving some small support to IDPs traveling to Juba to meet with the Pope.</narrative>
  </description>
